  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the area (in sq. units) bounded by the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi></math> and the line <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, then <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "FOIGY",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "CB7gA",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bU87S",
      "text": "<math><mn>48</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "EkaWQ",
      "text": "<math><mn>24</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given equations are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;above equations, we can write</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c2cfafb4-f818-42b9-a4da-d48162790b0f-image3.png\" /></p><p>Area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac></munderover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the required value is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>24</mn></math>.</p>",
